msgstr "traduction automatique"

#: models.py:54
msgid "Show the buttons to translate with AI."
msgstr "Afficher les boutons pour traduire avec l'IA."

#: models.py:57
msgid "glossary"
msgstr "glossaire"

#: models.py:60
msgid ""
"Terms that must always be translated the same way, one per line, e.g. "
"'fromage = cheese'. With more languages: 'fromage = en: cheese | nl: kaas'."
msgstr ""
"Termes à traduire toujours de la même façon, un par ligne, p. ex. 'fromage ="
" cheese'. Avec plusieurs langues : 'fromage = en: cheese | nl: kaas'."

#: models.py:66
msgid "instructions"
msgstr "instructions"

#: models.py:69
msgid ""
"Extra instructions for the AI that apply to the whole site, one per line. "
"Fixed translations of terms go in the glossary. Examples: 'Use a formal, "
"factual tone.' or 'Use a friendly, informal tone with short sentences.' "
"'Address the reader as you; in French always use vous.' 'Use British English"
" spelling.' 'Keep product and place names as they are.' 'Write dates as 17 "
"October 2026.'"
msgstr ""
"Instructions supplémentaires pour l'IA, valables pour tout le site, une par "
"ligne. Les traductions fixes de termes vont dans le glossaire. Exemples : "
"'Use a formal, factual tone.' ou 'Use a friendly, informal tone with short "
"sentences.' 'Address the reader as you; in French always use vous.' 'Use "
"British English spelling.' 'Keep product and place names as they are.' "
"'Write dates as 17 October 2026.'"

#: models.py:79
msgid "monthly budget (USD)"
msgstr "budget mensuel (USD)"

#: models.py:85
msgid ""
"Estimated cost of machine translation per month. When it is reached, the AI "
"buttons are hidden until next month. Empty = no limit. The real bill is in "
"the provider's console."
msgstr ""
"Coût estimé de la traduction automatique par mois. Une fois atteint, les "
"boutons IA sont masqués jusqu'au mois suivant. Vide = pas de limite. La "
"facture réelle est dans la console du fournisseur."

